<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Control of products we sell transfers to customers upon shipment from our facilities or delivery to our customers, and the Company&#8217;s performance obligations are satisfied at that time. Shipping and handling activities are performed before the customer obtains control of the goods and therefore represent a fulfillment activity rather than promised goods to the customer. Payments for sales are generally made by check, credit card, or wire transfer. Historically the Company has not experienced any significant payment delays from customers.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">For direct-to-consumer sales, with the exception of Irwin Products, the Company allows for returns within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ContractWithCustomerSalesChannelAxis-SalesChannelDirectlyToConsumerMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-ProductsExcludingIrwinProductsMember" name="ftlf:ReturnPeriod" id="c498" format="ixt-sec:durday">30</ix:nonNumeric> days of purchase. Irwin allows for returns within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ContractWithCustomerSalesChannelAxis-SalesChannelDirectlyToConsumerMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-IrwinProductsMember" name="ftlf:ReturnPeriod" id="c499" format="ixt-sec:durday">60</ix:nonNumeric> days of purchase for direct-to-consumer sales. Our wholesale customers may return purchased products to the Company under certain circumstances, which include expired or soon-to-be-expired products located in retail stores or distribution centers, and products that are subject to a recall or that contain an ingredient or ingredients that are subject to a recall by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (&#8220;<i>FDA</i>&#8221;).</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">A right of return does not represent a separate performance obligation, but because customers are allowed to return products, the consideration to which the Company expects to be entitled is variable. Such elements of variable consideration include, but are not limited to, estimated sales allowances, defective products, product returns and sales incentives, such as markdowns and sales promotions. The Company uses the most likely amount method to quantify the variable consideration. We assess our contracts and the reasonableness of our conclusions on a quarterly basis.</p>
</ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk" id="c301897720241794" escape="true">
<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Customer and Vendor Concentration</i></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Total net sales to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c500"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c501">one</span></span> customer during the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 represented <ix:nonFraction id="c502" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">11</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction id="c503" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="1">10</ix:nonFraction>% of net sales, respectively. Total net sales to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c504"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c505">one</span></span> customer during the three and six months ended June 30, 2025 represented <ix:nonFraction id="c506" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">22</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction id="c507" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">19</ix:nonFraction>% of net sales, respectively.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">For the three months ended June 30, 2026, there were <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c508">three</span> vendors who accounted for <ix:nonFraction id="c509" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">46</ix:nonFraction>%, <ix:nonFraction id="c510" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorTwoMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">13</ix:nonFraction>%, and <ix:nonFraction id="c511" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorThreeMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">12</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s consolidated inventory-related purchases, respectively. For the three months ended June 30, 2025, there were <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c512">three</span> vendors who accounted for <ix:nonFraction id="c513" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="1">50</ix:nonFraction>%, <ix:nonFraction id="c514" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorTwoMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">12</ix:nonFraction>%, and <ix:nonFraction id="c515" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorThreeMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">11</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s consolidated inventory-related purchases, respectively. For the six months ended June 30, 2026, there were <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c516">three</span> vendors who accounted for <ix:nonFraction id="c517" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">49</ix:nonFraction>%, <ix:nonFraction id="c518" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorTwoMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">14</ix:nonFraction>%, and <ix:nonFraction id="c519" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorThreeMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">11</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s consolidated inventory-related purchases, respectively. For the six months ended June 30, 2025, there were <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c520">two</span> vendors who accounted for <ix:nonFraction id="c521" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorOneMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">52</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction id="c522" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-InventoryrelatedPurchasesMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-SupplierConcentrationRiskMember_ShareBasedGoodsAndNonemployeeServicesTransactionBySupplierAxis-VendorTwoMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">13</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s consolidated inventory-related purchases, respectively.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
